- Subtitle Edit: https://github.com/SubtitleEdit/subtitleedit — UX reference only, no code copied.
Dependencies and their licenses are available in package-lock.json and the respective packages.

- morluto/rea, MIT: https://github.com/morluto/rea — methodology reviewed; no REA code copied or bundled.
- JSZip, MIT or GPL-3.0 (MIT selected): https://github.com/Stuk/jszip — dependency for client-side ZIP export.
- subtitlestranslator.com and translatesubtitles.co — public descriptions used for UX research only; no code copied.
